 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Working with Assets</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"From the Asset Workbench, you can add asset information, such as asset type or asset numbers for each ordered item, and create asset groups.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"From the Asset Workbench, you can add asset information, such as asset type or asset numbers for each ordered item, and create asset groups.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page concept  - topic-topic concept-concept \" id=\"loio3cca92fa576f42ea974a4df20e13c2cc\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Working with Assets</h1><div class=\"body conbody\"><p class=\"shortdesc\">From the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Asset Workbench</span>, you can add asset information, such as\nasset type or asset numbers for each ordered item, and create asset groups.</p>\n<p class=\"p\"></p>\n</div><div class=\"related-links\"> <br><ul class=\"ullinks\"><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"e6416b8fa4ee479ba1d29a22f9b72038.html\" title=\"If you're an asset manager, use this procedure to enter asset information for the asset line items on a requisition on the Asset Workbench.\">Adding Asset Information on a Requisition</a></strong><br></div><div><strong><a class=\"link\" href=\"ace1446d42344c5db37190fe9344e0ed.html\" title=\"Use this procedure to group items based on their asset line types before you approve a requisition in the Asset Workbench.\">Creating Asset Groups</a></strong><br></div></ul></div></div></section><div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
